    </li> <li> <div id="p-0147" num="0000" class="description-line">where p/p<sub>0 </sub>is the relative pressure, n is the amount of adsorbed N<sub>2 </sub>[mol/g], C is a constant (calculated from this linear fit), and n<sub>m </sub>is the BET monolayer capacity [mol/g] (also calculated from this linear fit). The SSA is then calculated from the following Equation 2:</div>
    </li> <li> <div id="p-0148" num="0000" class="description-line">
      <maths id="MATH-US-00002" num="00002">
