    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00021" num="00021" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>21</b>. The method of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00020">claim 20</claim-ref>, wherein:
<div class="claim-text">the thickness of the separator coating is in a range of about 1.0 μm to about 3.0 μm.</div> </div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00022" num="00022" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>22</b>. The method of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00016">claim 16</claim-ref>, wherein:
