    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00023" num="00023" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>23</b>. The method of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00016">claim 16</claim-ref>, wherein:
<div class="claim-text">an average length of the HARCPs is in a range of about 1.0 μm to about 30.0 μm; and/or</div> <div class="claim-text">an average length of the LARCPs is in a range of about 0.1 μm to about 3.0 μm.</div> </div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00024" num="00024" class="claim">
